            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "definition",
            "title": "Logical operators",
            "text": "Logical operators sharait ya expressions ko milate hain. Aam operators and, or aur not hain, aur yeh Boolean qeematein lautate hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "x = True, y = False ke saath logical operators",
            "header": [
              "Expression",
              "Qaida",
              "Nateeja"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "x and y",
                "tabhi True jab dono True",
                "False"
              ],
              [
                "x or y",
                "True agar kam az kam ek True",
                "True"
              ],
              [
                "not x",
                "qeemat ulat deta hai",
                "False"
              ],
              [
                "not y",
                "qeemat ulat deta hai",
                "True"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Kitab x or y ke comment mein 'True and False = True' likhti hai. Kya likha hona chahiye?",
            "explanation": "True or False = True: us line mein operator or hai, and nahi."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Fauri khulasa"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "and: dono sach; or: kam az kam ek sach; not: ulat."
            ]
